  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>&nbsp;satisfy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "248",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Similarly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></msup><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>96</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>solving eq.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>124</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>124</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>248</mn></math></p>"
  }
